        "intro": "Expect the strings of fate to bring you prosperity!",
        "flavortext": "A toxin isn’t always a chemical that physically harms living things. Sometimes it’s an abstract poison that seeps between the cracks of relationships in people, corroding love and trust as it accumulates. \n\n Thankfully, there are medicines for that sort of toxin–self-love and self-awareness among them. Be open to criticism and seek improvement day by day, and the toxins will vanish as if you had used a Full Restore!"
